        "text": "Step 1: To find the real roots of the given equation, we first simplify the left-hand side of the equation. The equation is:\n\\[\n\\frac{( x+ 1)(x - 3)}{5(x + 2)(x - 4)} + \\frac{(x + 3)(x - 5)}{9(x + 4)(x - 6)} - \\frac{2(x + 5)(x - 7)}{13(x + 6)(x - 8)} = \\frac{92}{585}.\n\\]"
