        "prefix_token_count": 191,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: We need to find a common denominator for the fractions on the left-hand side. The common denominator is \\(5 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 4)(x - 6)(x + 6)(x - 8)\\)."
