        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Rewrite each fraction with the common denominator:\n\\[\n\\frac{9 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 1)(x - 3) \\cdot (x + 4)(x - 6)(x + 6)(x - 8)}{5 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 4)(x - 6)(x + 6)(x - 8)} + \\frac{5 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 3)(x - 5) \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 6)(x - 8)}{5 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 4)(x - 6)(x + 6)(x - 8)} - \\frac{5 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 2 \\cdot (x + 5)(x - 7) \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 4)(x - 6)}{5 \\cdot 9 \\cdot 13 \\cdot (x + 2)(x - 4)(x + 4)(x - 6)(x + 6)(x - 8)} = \\frac{92}{585}.\n\\]"
